ation coordinate type                    CRPIX1  =   3.1874099147755715 / [pixel] reference pixel along image axis 1     CRPIX2  =   2.6017567460260693 / [pixel] reference pixel along image axis 2     CRVAL1  =          287.8523895 / [deg] right ascension at reference pixel       CRVAL2  =             43.89799 / [deg] declination at reference pixel           CUNIT1  = 'deg     '           / physical unit in column dimension              CUNIT2  = 'deg     '           / physical unit in row dimension                 CDELT1  =   -0.001106294245384 / [deg] pixel scale in RA dimension              CDELT2  = 0.001106294245384243 / [deg] pixel scale in Dec dimension             PC1_1   =  -0.5730251661627159 / linear transformation element cos(th)          PC1_2   =   0.8215956675177057 / linear transformation element -sin(th)         PC2_1   =  -0.8190833354128445 / linear transformation element sin(th)          PC2_2   =  -0.5707335377238699 / linear transformation element cos(th)          WCSNAMEP= 'PHYSICAL'           / name of world coordinate system alternate P    WCSAXESP=                    2 / number of WCS physical axes                    CTYPE1P = 'RAWX    '           / physical WCS axis 1 type CCD col               CUNIT1P = 'PIXEL   '           / physical WCS axis 1 unit                       CRPIX1P =                    1 / reference CCD column                           CRVAL1P =                  538 / value at reference CCD column                  CDELT1P =                  1.0 / physical WCS axis 1 step                       CTYPE2P = 'RAWY    '           / physical WCS axis 2 type CCD row               CUNIT2P = 'PIXEL   '           / physical WCS axis 2 units                      CRPIX2P =                    1 / reference CCD row                              CRVAL2P =                  315 / value at reference CCD row                     CDELT2P =                  1.0 / physical WCS axis 2 step                       NPIXSAP =                    3 / Number